From 69172227c1d940e1c262e3f7e16758ed2d2080f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josep Torra <n770galaxy@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 20:26:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 17/25] drm/gma500: parse SGX firmware format v3 with copy
 templates

Format v3 adds the copy blit's USE shader and single-source PDS primary to
the transfer templates, raises the template and parameter limits, and adds
the texture-state parameters. Teach the parser to read it, to build a copy,
and to place and patch only the templates an operation uses. v1 and v2 files
still load. KUnit covers the new paths.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Josep Torra <n770galaxy@gmail.com>
---
